%% Port Contracts — Data Sources view
%% Covers DataSource-related domain ports and infrastructure adapters.

%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date    2026-02-25
%% @type    flowchart
%% @level   System / Component
%% @status  active
%% @view    data-sources
%% @parent  13-port-protocol-contracts.mmd
